  "description": "A widely circulated and often harmful stereotype or narrative that is used to demean or dehumanize a group. The meme relies on the racist trope that Black people are inherently violent or criminal, which is used to justify the false claim that African American leaders were organizing the riots. This trope is a key element of the meme's hateful intent.",
